A. 18 [5] < $\mathrm{\S A.3} >$ What is the function implemented by the following Verilog modules:

modules:

```verilog

module FUNC1 (I0, I1, S, out);

    input I0, I1;

    input S;

    output out;

    out = S? I1: I0;

endmodule

module FUNC2 (out,ctl,clk,reset);

    output [7:0] out;

    input ctl, clk, reset;

    reg [7:0] out;

    always @(posedge clk)

    if (reset) begin

        out <= 8'b0 ;

    end

    else if (ctl) begin

        out <= out + 1;

    end

    else begin

        out <= out - 1;

    end

endmodule

```

